		{"A structure that seems to be a kind of museum. ", "Une structure qui semble être une sorte de musée. "},
		{"A tall, dark tower with a staircase leading up.", "Une haute tour sombre, avec un escalier qui monte."},
		{"A large structure built on a tall foundation. ", "Une grande structure bâtie sur de hautes fondations. "},
		{"A radial structure with a large chamber above.", "Une structure radiale surmontée d'une grande chambre."},
		{"There's an odd arrangement of hallways inside.", "À l'intérieur, un agencement de couloirs étrange."},
